{
  "$description": "The pinned selection of the twelve branded slides-v2 backgrounds (decisions 0012 and 0013: the closed-cube set of 2026-09-16, four of its files replaced the same day by precise-object edits of their own generation output, two of them through a chain of two edits). node scripts/validate.mjs --only branded compares this file with the provenance records, the staged prompt file, the files on disk (hash, dimensions, opacity, safe-zone luminance), the public onboarding illustrations the generator received as references, the pinned edits (generation id, kind, verbatim edit prompt, edit target by hash, and every earlier edit of a chain as superseded lineage), the contact sheets, the decision record, the source register, the galleries and the public wording, so that a replaced file, a changed prompt, an unpinned edit or lineage entry, a loosened contract, a re-ordered contact sheet, a licence sentence that drifts, a prompt that drops the closed-cube geometry or asks for an opening, or a document that falls back to the flat-badge or open-receptacle form fails the gate. The geometry check is a keyword and pattern gate over the prompt text, not a proof of what the pixels show. Changing a pinned value here is a deliberate, reviewable act.",
