    "editKinds": {
      "$description": "The kinds of precise-object edit a pinned file may carry, each adding its requirements (over the whole edit prompt) and Avoid requirements (over its Avoid lines) to the core edit contract. A final pinned edit names one of these kinds in the record, the staged file and the pin; a lineage edit (superseded history) is held to the core contract only.",
      "object-replacement": {
        "$description": "A scene object (the sneaker, the blank cube) replaced by brand-neutral rounded shapes: the replacement carries no text, logo or branding, the UP! cubes are not moved or reshaped, and footwear, swooshes, stripes, logos, emblems, words, letters and monograms are rejected.",
